% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/labour/night_work. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure
% by name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% This domain: parameters-sources.yaml is not a commissioning register, so
% no records are written.
%   - National figures are the caller's profile keys, never parameters:
%     night time, the reference period, and what counts as hazardous work.
%   - The Directive's own figures are declared with constant_value/2 in
%     the module that reads them. These are eight hours (480 minutes), 24
%     hours (1440 minutes), seven hours (420 minutes) and 05:00 (minute
%     300). Their wording is quoted in citations.clausal (Art 2(3), Art 8(a),
%     Art 8(b)).
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
